{"agent":"lk-snap","data":{"fix_task":"fix-Bd7117525b9","item":"LK-hook-snapshot","repro":{"bytes":5471,"mode":"full","ref":"sha256:a187f9aee2230823c1961de3d29036a4dfd1e497fe454d9871de7150471e09ff","truncated":false},"severity":"low","summary":"Three LK tasks (LK-hook-snapshot, LK-observed-globs, LK-sg-events) each add a config section; registering one needs edits to the shared config/__init__.py and config/_core.py (and LK-hook-snapshot and LK-observed-globs both create config_sections/locks.py), so claims refuse each other. A section registry by convention (auto-discover config_sections/*.py) would remove the shared files.","title":"New config section forces a lease on ddflow/config/__init__.py and _core.py: parallel tasks adding [locks]/[handoff] block each other"},"id":"eaca2f522b4bab70cae2b67ec","kind":"bug.found","lamport":127556,"schema":1,"subject":"Bd7117525b9","ts":"2026-11-02T08:49:39.918989Z"}
{"agent":"lk-snap","data":{"body":"Fixes bug Bd7117525b9: Three LK tasks (LK-hook-snapshot, LK-observed-globs, LK-sg-events) each add a config section; registering one needs edits to the shared config/__init__.py and config/_core.py (and LK-hook-snapshot and LK-observed-globs both create config_sections/locks.py), so claims refuse each other. A section registry by convention (auto-discover config_sections/*.py) would remove the shared files. Found on LK-hook-snapshot.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-Bd7117525b9 --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed Bd7117525b9 --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["Bd7117525b9"],"globs":[],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs-2","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug Bd7117525b9: New config section forces a lease on ddflow/config/__init__.py and _core.py: parallel tasks addi..."},"id":"e6a5ec6914529b25f64d0168d","kind":"task.added","lamport":127557,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-Bd7117525b9","ts":"2026-11-02T08:49:40.463367Z"}
